l:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete: cmd-5b79627dd82b419e records the healthy pre-restart service and boot identity; cmd-316bd293be8c4377 acknowledges restart scheduling; the timeout observations show the bounded disruption; cmd-a637c40761354396 and cmd-1423958260b2459c show a different boot identity, a healthy system, and recovered service state. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":[]}
